              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Poi 16:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man i dwi ma kwong’ane, i ceng’ apar wi ang’wende mi dwi, en e kadhukuwijo pa Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.14+EXO.12.15+EXO.12.16+EXO.12.17+EXO.12.18+EXO.12.19+EXO.12.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ai 12:14-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "23:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.3+DEU.16.4+DEU.16.5+DEU.16.6+DEU.16.7+DEU.16.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Poi 16:3-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man i ceng’ apar wi abije mi dwi maeni bibedo agba: jubicamu kwen ma thobi mbe i ie ceng’ abiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ceng’ ma kwong’ane bibedo cokri ma leng’: wubitimo tic moko ma jumuli ko ngo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento wubithiero lam ma jutimo ku mac, lam m’awang’a ni Yehova: thwoni dhiang’ ario m’aradu, ku nyog rombo acel, ku nyithi nyogi rombe abiro ma rundigi acel acel; gibibedo ma mulima mbe i kumgi iwu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man lam mi mogone, mogo ma yom ma jujebo ku mo: wubithiero ng’ete mir apaje adek mi thwon dhiang’, man ng’ete mir apaje ario mi nyog rombo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wubithiero ng’ete mir apaje acel mi nyithi rombe abiro kubang’e kubang’e; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man nyog diel acel ni lam mi dubo, kara utim adunya piwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubithiero maeni umed lam m’awang’a mi kugweno, ma en e ni lam m’awang’a ma thiri thiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubithiero ceng’ ku ceng’ calu maeni, ceng’ abiro, cemo mi lam ma jutimo ku mac, ni ng’wic mido ma ng’ar ni Yehova: jubithiere umed lam m’awang’a ma thiri thiri, ku lam m’amadhane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man i ceng’ abirone wubibedo ku cokri ma leng’; wubitimo tic moko ma jumuli ko ngo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
